Package: aegis-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, apparmor, apparmor-profiles
Recommends: apparmor-profiles-extra, fastfetch
Description: Aegis OS base integration and kernel hardening
 Core Aegis OS integration installed on every Aegis system:
  * conservative kernel hardening via sysctl (kptr/dmesg restrict, ptrace
    scope, BPF/userns limits, rp_filter, ASLR, ...);
  * module blacklists that cut attack surface (dccp/sctp/rds/firewire/...);
  * AppArmor enablement;
  * OS branding (os-release / issue / motd / GRUB distributor).
 .
 This package is pulled in by the aegis-meta metapackage.
